{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24426","headline":"酬思黯相公晚夏雨後感秋见赠 · 白居易","name":"酬思黯相公晚夏雨後感秋见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮去朝来无歇期，炎凉闇向雨中移。\n夜长祗合愁人觉，秋冷先应瘦客知。\n两幅彩笺挥逸翰，一声寒玉振清辞。\n无忧无病身荣贵，何故沈吟亦感时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}